              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "paraître — \"to come out, to be published; to seem\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Le magazine paraît tous les jeudis. The magazine comes out every Thursday."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Two senses: to be published, and il paraît que — it seems, people say. The current spelling also allows paraitre."
            }
          ]
        },
